# PROJECT: AI-Based Resume Matching & Ranking System

Act as a Senior AI/ML Engineer, Full Stack Developer, UI/UX Designer, and Software Architect.

Build a complete, professional, production-style web application called **AI TalentMatch – Intelligent Resume Matching & Ranking System**.

The application should help recruiters automatically analyze resumes, compare candidates against job descriptions, calculate matching scores, rank applicants, and identify the most suitable candidates.

## 1. TECHNOLOGY STACK

